meta {
  name: dat
}

docs {
  # DAT catalogs

  Public routes. After `npm run db:seed` every catalog is already imported,
  so 03 answers 409 instead of 201. 05 deletes an unknown ID on purpose:
  deleting a real catalog would break the demo data. 06 sends an empty upload
  on purpose: a real one would add a catalog to the demo data.
}
